  m_text: '

    Hello!

    Are you ready to start your training.

    Here are
    some steps on how to create your first drink.


    1) Grab mug

    2) A recipe
    will appear and follow the recipe to complete a drink

    3) The flavor dispenser
    will have different options for you to chose

    4) Add the espresso to the
    mug

    5) The milk dispenser will have different options for you to chose

    6)If
    you mess up  anytime, the mug will disappear and you will start over until you
    completed the recipe correctly

    7) After completing the recipe, you will
    recieve a certificate of finishing your traning here with us!'
